= Anti-Fengtian War

After Feng Yuxiang's betrayal against the Zhili, the political balance in China has shifted wildly. Now, Zhang Zuolin and Wu Peifu have unexpectedly banded together to defeat Feng Yuxiang after his betrayal. The northeast marches to war once again.

The Guominjun is preparing for battle. General Guo Songling of Fengtian has defected to the Guominjun and has begun a siege of Mukden.
